{"book":"ezra","num":9,"verses":[{"en":"Now when these things were done, the princes came to me, saying, The people of Israel, and the priests, and the Levites, have not separated themselves from the people of the lands, doing according to their abominations, even of the Canaanites, the Hittites, the Perizzites, the Jebusites, the Ammonites, the Moabites, the Egyptians, and the Amorites.","n":1,"sm":"Isaraelu ma nuu ese Ua uma nei mea, ona o mai lea ia te au o alii, ua faapea mai, O le nuu o Isaraelu, ma le au faitaulaga, ma sa Levi, ua latou le vavaeina i latou ai tagata o nuu ese, a o loo fai e tusa ma a latou mea e inosia, o sa Kanana, o sa Heu, o sa Perisé, o sa Iepuse, o sa Amoni, o sa Moapi, o tagata Aikupito, ma sa Amori.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"ese"},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"nei"},{"en":"","sm":"mea,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"alii,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"mai,"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"faitaulaga,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"Levi,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vavaeina"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"ese,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"loo"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tusa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"inosia,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"Kanana,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"