"},{"en":"","sm":"faalogo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lenei"},{"en":"","sm":"mea,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"saeia"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"ofu"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"ofu"},{"en":"","sm":"talaloa,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"futi"},{"en":"","sm":"oʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"lauulu,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"‘ava,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"nofo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lalo"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"segia"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"mauli."}]},{"en":"Then were assembled unto me every one that trembled at the words of the God of Israel, because of the transgression of those that had been carried away; and I sat astonied until the evening sacrifice.","n":4,"sm":"Ona potopoto mai ai lea ia te au o i latou uma na matatau i afioga a le Atua o Isaraelu, ona o le agasala a le tafeaga; ua ou nofo foi ua segia loʻu mauli, ua oo i le taulaga o le afiafi.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"potopoto"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"matatau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"afioga"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"agasala"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tafeaga;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"nofo"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"segia"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"mauli,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"oo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"taulaga"},{"en":"","sm":"o"}